क्षुद्रं हृदयदौर्बल्यं त्यक्त्वोत्तिष्ठ परन्तप ॥ ३ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":460,\"bb\":420,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/2/3/b420/\",\"body_value\":\"klaibyaṁ mā sma gamaḥ pārtha
naitat tvayy upapadyate
